      "problem": "$9$ is divisible by $4$, or $8$ is **not** divisible by $3.$\n\nExpress the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following:\n\n- $P:9\\text{ is divisible by }4$\n\n- $Q:8\\text{ is divisible by }3$",
